OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners criticise First Bus
OL,4,Acontract plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have criticised plans to
OL,7,Faward First Bus a contract to run
OL,8,Fservices in parts of West Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe West Yorkshire Combined Authority
OL,11,F(WYCA) announced that it intended to
OL,12,Fallow First to operate in Huddersfield
OL,13,Fand parts of Leeds, as part of a new
OL,14,Ffranchising system.
OL,16,FBut the group Better Buses for West
OL,17,FYorkshire said First's West Yorkshire
OL,18,Fdivision was one of "Britain's worst
OL,19,Fbus operators", citing its low rank in
OL,20,Fa recent transport survey.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
